    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933310/extras/155e718407e0f76a6f05e4a29ebeb1eb.poster.avif?t=1735849412\" width=592 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933310/extras/155e718407e0f76a6f05e4a29ebeb1eb.webm?t=1735849412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933310/extras/4b2fc5ec9936a3655318b493e9a2fa2c.avif?t=1735849412\" width=616 height=228 /></span><br>In <strong>Raising Legion</strong>, a one-click rogue-like autobattler, you will gather an army and bring destruction. Enlist troops from 8 factions, each with their unique effects, and guide them to victory against over 60 different treacherous enemies.<br><br>You, an honourable mercenary, have been cowardly betrayed, they knifed your back and killed your men. You did nothing to earn their rage, you just did your job as well as you could, maybe too well. Now you must raise from the ashes and bring destruction upon the snakes that gave you for dead, whatever the cost.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933310/extras/3dc14e0024f1677d8d8e51b04690b89c.poster.avif?t=1735849412\" width=604 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933310/extras/3dc14e0024f1677d8d8e51b04690b89c.webm?t=1735849412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933310/extras/2ce5a3abcaeaee001be04228b428803d.avif?t=1735849412\" width=608 height=90 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Eight fearsome factions!</strong> - Descend into battle with an army composed of Dwarves, Fishfolk, Goblins, Kobolds, Lizardfolk, Orcs, Ratfolk, and Undead<br></li><li><strong>Embody the General!</strong> - Decide which unit to enlist in your rebelling legion, each with their unique effect and statistics. Discard whoever stops being useful, victory is your only objective.<br></li><li><strong>Victory comes first!</strong> - Your weapon is strategy, build around each soldier strengths, and maximise their effectiveness in battle; and once you are ready, let them die for your success!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933310/extras/2cbb634c9a9aa7ca6e17338d5032c037.poster.avif?t=1735849412\" width=604 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933310/extras/2cbb634c9a9aa7ca6e17338d5032c037.webm?t=1735849412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933310/extras/e6c861fb35f3de953fb0f134422e468a.avif?t=1735849412\" width=608 height=90 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Enemies aplenty!</strong> - Humans, Beasts, and unspeakable Horrors will try to stop you from succeeding.<br></li><li><strong>Face the odds!</strong> - With the randomly generated choices of units and the enemies layouts, you will have to adapt to unforeseen situations. Think on your toes and be flexible.</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933310/extras/924a1364d50f0d0a61ae864cec72b4f2.poster.avif?t=1735849412\" width=592 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933310/extras/924a1364d50f0d0a61ae864cec72b4f2.webm?t=1735849412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
